This product includes protocol documentation derived from
melitta-barista-ha (https://github.com/dzerik/melitta-barista-ha),
Copyright (c) 2025 dzerik, distributed under the MIT License.

Specifically, the following protocol facts in this repository were taken
from that project's documentation and constant tables:

  * the RC4 stream key used by the Eugster/Frismag BLE stack,
  * the 256-byte lookup table used by the HU handshake verifier,
  * the GATT service and characteristic UUIDs,
  * the command set, frame layout, status/recipe payload layouts, register
    IDs and recipe IDs described in docs/PROTOCOL.md.

The source code in this repository is an independent implementation.
